<div class="qin-dialog">
  <p>Chi cost = the effect's level; effects "paid in Chi" cost their bonus. Effects marked <span class="qin-src qin-src-tao">Tao</span> are applied for you: they wait for the next roll that uses them, or run for their rounds.</p>
  {{#each levels}}
  <label class="qin-radio"><input type="radio" name="level" value="{{value}}" {{#if @first}}checked{{/if}}> <b>{{#if (eq value "any")}}Any level{{else}}Level {{level}}{{/if}}</b> ({{cost}} Chi): {{#if auto}}<span class="qin-src qin-src-tao">Tao</span> {{auto}}{{#if text}} <span class="qin-muted">— {{text}}</span>{{/if}}{{else}}{{text}}{{/if}}</label>
  {{/each}}
</div>
